V12.6
- VIP / Premium / Starter mother product may list directly with fixed quantity 1.
- Mother direct listing media standardized to 1 photo + 1 video, with its own Draft / Update / Publish / Unpublish controls.
- Premium / Starter Child can coexist with the listed mother product.
- Child creation is continuous without saving between additions; active capacity is 10 per room.
- Child IDs are monotonic and never reused; Sold Child remains history and does not consume the 10-active capacity.
- New Child inherits mother price, dimensions, package suggestion and weight; individual price/dimension changes remain available.
- Each Child media is limited to 1 photo + 1 video.
- Child publishing is batch per room: all current active Child publish/unpublish together; unwanted Child should be deleted before listing.
- Random remains independent with mother ID only, no Child, display-only 5 photos + 1 video and quantity-pool logic.

V12.6 CLEAN PATCH
- All rooms: after selecting a product, hide overview search/results/list and show only the current editor.
- Random is a true independent room: one mother product ID, no Child/Variations, shared editable dimensions, one visible price.
- Random media remains Display Only: max 5 photos + 1 video.
- Random quantity pool capped at 20 and further limited by current real available stock.
- Random Close and Remove Room now use the same warning/return model as Starter.
- Random Draft/Update Draft/Publish/Unpublish uses the same workflow model as Starter.
- Random allocation/publication no longer depends on Starter Variations state.

Lover Legend Online Store - CHANGELOG

V12.6 CLEAN
- Base: V11.3 CLEAN PATCH.
- Force Online Store Import read-only startup mode; inherited Import CRUD/history/repair modules no longer initialize in Online Store.
- Removed legacy Import operation pages: Import, old Import History, Supplier/Import maintenance page.
- Removed legacy Import settings/repair panels from Settings.
- Kept future business modules and navigation positions: Affiliate, Finance, Marketing, Logistics, Holiday Mode, Security/Staff Auth.
- Simplified Security settings UI to a future Staff Auth placeholder while preserving the existing app-entry mechanism.
- Simplified Automatic Minimum Price to one global Target Net Margin. Factory default 30%; editable; Reset to Factory restores 30%.
- Removed cost-band target-margin UI. Runtime pricing uses the same global margin for all products while still including actual Import average cost and enabled Online costs.
- Kept Import Read-Only product/stock/average cost/minimum price bridge, Online Backup/Restore, Online History, Templates, Pricing, Room/Child/Random logic, and data-safety logic.
- Updated visible version/cache metadata to V12.6 / build 12600.
